<p>
            At $3,495 each on 5 November 2026, these two are the obvious pair, and they are genuinely
            different machines.
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[520px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr>
