        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Rogue does not make a treadmill; it sells Woodway, TrueForm and STEPR
          machines from $3,495 to $11,395, at the same prices the makers charged when we checked.</strong> The
          "Rogue treadmill" is the Rogue | Woodway Curve LTG, a Rogue-branded Woodway curved manual treadmill at
          $3,495 on sale, and for most buyers the real choice is between it and the TrueForm Trainer at the same
          price.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Choose the Curve LTG for its longer deck, the
          <a href="/trueform-treadmills/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">TrueForm Trainer</a>
